<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
        推断 · 评估单元
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        48 个块，而不是 16,733 场比赛
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 48, marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 600 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                每个「联赛 × 赛季」重训一次，只用更早的比赛
            </Text>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 72, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>2017/18</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 24, height: 30, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', marginLeft: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 72, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>2018/19</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 32, height: 30, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', marginLeft: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 72, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>2019/20</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 40, height: 30, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', marginLeft: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 72, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>2020/21</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 48, height: 30, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', marginLeft: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 72, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>2024/25</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 62, height: 30, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 36, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', marginLeft: 3 }} />
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 16, height: 14, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>训练窗</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 16, height: 14, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>测试块（一个联赛 × 赛季）</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 512, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>48</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    个独立单元——8 个赛季 × 6 个联赛
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>16,733</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    块内被打分的比赛，从不逐场重抽
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>1.32–1.89</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    实测设计效应：区间宽度是朴素宽度的 √deff ≈ 1.15–1.37 倍
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            同一块内的比赛共享球队与赛程。把它们当独立样本重抽会低估不确定性，所以这里每个区间都重抽整块——10,000 次。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · 统计机器学习 I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>第 32 组 · 5/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
